# 防止 EOL/文本转换破坏二进制文件（PDF/docx/图片/固件/编译产物在 checkout 时被 CRLF 损坏）
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.doc   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.rar   binary
*.gz    binary
*.bin   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.out   binary
*.hex   binary
*.elf   binary
*.o     binary
*.obj   binary
# K230/嘉楠 AI 模型（nncase 编出来的 .kmodel）。git 靠 NUL 字节也能自动判二进制，
# 但别依赖自动检测 —— 换台机器的 core.autocrlf 一旦生效就会静默损坏模型文件。
*.kmodel binary
